{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"e71a229c-c834-42d9-9cdf-dbc1cce0b10a","title":"GitHub Pages limits","desc":"The published size, bandwidth and build ceilings that shape what this site can hold.","updated":1788417991064,"created":1788417991064,"tags":["meta","hosting","constraints"],"custom":{},"fname":"sources.github-pages-limits","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"999104c2c0aa2bc78bd23f4b16ecfe53","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"sources.github-pages-limits","id":"e71a229c-c834-42d9-9cdf-dbc1cce0b10a","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.meta","alias":"meta","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.meta"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"sources.github-pages-limits","id":"e71a229c-c834-42d9-9cdf-dbc1cce0b10a","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.hosting","alias":"hosting","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.hosting"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"sources.github-pages-limits","id":"e71a229c-c834-42d9-9cdf-dbc1cce0b10a","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.constraints","alias":"constraints","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.constraints"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"sources.github-pages-limits","id":"e71a229c-c834-42d9-9cdf-dbc1cce0b10a","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.media-budget","alias":"A budget for images and video","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":31,"offset":424},"end":{"line":12,"column":83,"offset":476},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.media-budget"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.media-budget","id":"d2d6721c-74a0-4ce6-aa40-40502d0a2626","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":29,"offset":924},"end":{"line":29,"column":80,"offset":975},"indent":[]},"value":"sources.github-pages-limits"},{"from":{"fname":"topics.how-this-notebook-works","id":"b43523ba-f71e-4459-bde8-67c52f7ca1dc","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":3,"offset":491},"end":{"line":12,"column":54,"offset":542},"indent":[]},"value":"sources.github-pages-limits"}],"anchors":{"what-it-says":{"type":"header","text":"What it says","value":"what-it-says","line":14,"column":0,"depth":2},"what-i-took-from-it":{"type":"header","text":"What I took from it","value":"what-i-took-from-it","line":21,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"cc4b8580-43e7-43b7-83b9-22c062bd511d","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"github-pages-limits\">GitHub Pages limits<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#github-pages-limits\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"what-it-says\">What it says<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#what-it-says\"></a></h2>\n<p>The reference page for what GitHub will and won't serve. A published site is\ncapped at 1 GB, bandwidth has a soft cap of 100 GB a month, and deployments\ntime out after ten minutes. Ten builds an hour, unless you build through your\nown Actions workflow — which this site does.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-i-took-from-it\">What I took from it<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#what-i-took-from-it\"></a></h2>\n<p>The 1 GB ceiling is the only constraint that really bites, and it bites on\nmedia rather than prose — see <a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/d2d6721c-74a0-4ce6-aa40-40502d0a2626\">A budget for images and video</a>.</p>\n<p>Source: <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/pages/getting-started-with-github-pages/github-pages-limits\">https://docs.github.com/en/pages/getting-started-with-github-pages/github-pages-limits</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">meta (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">hosting (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">constraints (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/d2d6721c-74a0-4ce6-aa40-40502d0a2626\">A budget for images and video</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/b43523ba-f71e-4459-bde8-67c52f7ca1dc\">How this notebook works</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"28a6a50b-4c15-4c7d-b603-5a1d12809f1c","title":"Notes","desc":"Ideas in my own words, revised over time rather than published once.","updated":1788417991064,"created":1788417991064,"tags":["meta"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"notes","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"1684a548ea270e4f1afc2c89cb1e47c9","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes","id":"28a6a50b-4c15-4c7d-b603-5a1d12809f1c","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.meta","alias":"meta","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.meta"}},{"from":{"fname":"root","id":"03cdc22b-eff8-4e94-bd04-96724d382caa","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":3,"offset":106},"end":{"line":5,"column":18,"offset":121},"indent":[]},"value":"notes"}],"anchors":{},"children":["d2d6721c-74a0-4ce6-aa40-40502d0a2626","7a8ae6a4-b61f-4521-9562-2f0ceadede8d","4ae2c7ca-0db8-4486-b1d3-7027f71420d3","b9466ca4-404f-4189-8355-3c768e665c25"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nIdeas in my own words, revised over time rather than published once. Every\nnote filed under this hierarchy shows up as a child below, and Dendron's\nbacklinks panel shows what links into each one.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":1,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelec